            "69014502": {
              "title": "Corrodeash",
              "desc": "· When there are 2/3 Agents with the <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> specialty in your squad, the whole squad's Anomaly Proficiency increases by <color=#2BAD00>20/60 points</color> respectively, and Anomaly Buildup Rate increases by <color=#2BAD00>10%/20%</color> respectively.\n· When an Agent inflicts an <color=#FFFFFF>Attribute Anomaly</color> on an enemy, the enemy's DEF is <color=#2BAD00>reduced by 10%</color> for 10s; repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69014503": {
              "title": "Sunfrost",
              "desc": "· <color=#FFFFFF>[Attack]</color> specialty Agents' <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20%</color>.\n· Agents' CRIT DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color>. When attacking a Stunned enemy, that enemy's Stun DMG Multiplier additionally <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20%</color> for 20s; repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
